<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF‑8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width‑device‑width, initial‑scale=1.0">
    <title>Ben NoKa ‑ Vua Chiến Dịch</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
            box‑sizing:border‑box;
            font‑family:Arial, sans‑serif;
        }
        body {
            background:#121212;
            color:#fff;
            min‑height:100vh;
            display:flex;
            flex‑direction:column;
            align‑items:center;
            padding:30px 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background:#1e1e1e;
            border‑radius:24px;
            max‑width:480px;
            width:100%;
            padding:30px 24px;
            text‑align:center;
            box‑shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,215,0,0.18);
        }
        .logo‑box {
            width:100%;
            max‑width:320px;
            height:320px;
            border‑radius:20px;
            overflow:hidden;
            margin:0 auto 20px;
            border:3px solid #c9a227;
        }
        .logo‑box img {
            width:100%;
            height:100%;
            object‑fit:cover;
        }
        h1 {
            font‑size:32px;
            color:#c9a227;
            margin‑bottom:8px;
        }
        h2 {
            font‑size:20px;
            color:#ddd;
            margin‑bottom:20px;
        }
        .desc {
            color:#bbbbbb;
            margin‑bottom:28px;
            line‑height:1.6;
        }
        .contact‑box {
            background:#111111;
            border‑radius:16px;
            padding:20px;
            margin‑bottom:24px;
        }
        .label {
            color:#888;
            font‑size:14px;
            margin‑bottom:6px;
        }
        .zalo‑text {
            font‑size:22px;
            font‑weight:bold;
            color:#0099ff;
        }
        .btn {
            display:block;
            text‑decoration:none;
            border‑radius:14px;
            padding:15px;
            margin:12px 0;
            font‑weight:bold;
            font‑size:16px;
        }
        .btn‑fb {
            background:#1877f2;
            color:white;
        }
        .btn‑zalo {
            background:#0099ff;
            color:white;
        }
        .btn‑discord {
            background:#5865F2;
            color:white;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="logo‑box">
            <img src="LOGO_BEN_NOKA.png" alt="Ben NoKa ‑ Vua Chiến Dịch">
        </div>
        <h1>Ben NoKa</h1>
        <h2>Vua Chiến Dịch</h2>
        <p class="desc">
            Trang profile chính thức Ben NoKa / KhaPlus<br>
            UY TÍN ✅ 🔱 Liên hệ ngay qua các kênh bên dưới
        </p>
        <div class="contact‑box">
            <div class="label">📞 Zalo</div>
            <div class="zalo‑text">0939483060</div>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn‑fb" href="https://www.facebook.com/share/1FnG5V7L2y/?mibextid=wwXIfr" target="_blank">📘 FACEBOOK</a>
        <a class="btn btn‑zalo" href="https://zalo.me/0939483060" target="_blank">💬 MỞ ZALO</a>
        <a class="btn btn‑discord" href="https://discord.gg/7mY4WyVdm" target="_blank">🔵 THAM GIA DISCORD</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
